# This lesson's server is the first in XR Camp to install an npm package
# (see package.json and the README's "Setup"): node_modules/ is rebuilt by
# `npm install` on any machine, so it is never committed. No lockfile is
# committed either — see the README for why a single pinned version in
# package.json is enough for this course.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# The SQLite database (reports only) and anything server.test.js writes.
data/

.env
